{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":140,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"To the choir director. A Psalm of David","tok":[{"t":"To the choir director. A "},{"t":"Psalm","s":["H4210"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"David","s":["H1732"],"a":[2]}]},{"n":1,"text":"Deliver me, O Jehovah, from evil men; From violent men preserve me;","tok":[{"t":"Deliver","s":["H2502"],"a":[0]},{"t":" me, O "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":", from "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[3]},{"t":" men; From "},{"t":"violent","s":["H2555"],"a":[5]},{"t":" men "},{"t":"preserve","s":["H5341"],"a":[6]},{"t":" me;"}]},{"n":2,"text":"Who devise evil schemes in their hearts And continually stir up wars.","tok":[{"t":"Who devise evil schemes in their "},{"t":"hearts","s":["H3820"],"a":[3]},{"t":" And "},{"t":"continually","s":["H3117"],"a":[5]},{"t":" stir up "},{"t":"wars","s":["H4421"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"They have sharpened their tongues like that of a serpent; The poison of adders is under their lips. Selah","tok":[{"t":"They have "},{"t":"sharpened","s":["H8150"],"a":[0]},{"t":" their "},{"t":"tongues","s":["H3956"],"a":[1]},{"t":" like that of a "},{"t":"serpent","s":["H5175"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; The "},{"t":"poison","s":["H2534"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"adders","s":["H5919"],"a":[5]},{"t":" is under their "},{"t":"lips","s":["H8193"],"a":[7]},{"t":". "},{"t":"Selah","s":["H5542"],"a":[8]}]},{"n":4,"text":"Keep me, O Jehovah, from the hands of the wicked; From violent men preserve me; Who devise schemes to thrust me down.","tok":[{"t":"Keep","s":["H8104"],"a":[0]},{"t":" me, O "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":", from the "},{"t":"hands","s":["H3027"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; From "},{"t":"violent","s":["H2555"],"a":[5]},{"t":" men "},{"t":"preserve","s":["H5341"],"a":[6]},{"t":" me; Who devise schemes to thrust me down."}]},{"n":5,"text":"The proud have hidden a trap for me and cords; They have spread a net by the wayside; They have set snares for me. Selah","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"proud","s":["H1343"],"a":[1]},{"t":" have hidden a trap for me and "},{"t":"cords","s":["H2256"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; They have "},{"t":"spread","s":["H6566"],"a":[5]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"net","s":["H7568"],"a":[6]},{"t":" by the "},{"t":"wayside","s":["H3027"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; They have "},{"t":"set","s":["H7896"],"a":[10]},{"t":" snares for me. "},{"t":"Selah","s":["H5542"],"a":[12]}]},{"n":6,"text":"I said to Jehovah, You are my God; Give ear, O Jehovah, to the voice of my supplications.","tok":[{"t":"I "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":", You are my "},{"t":"God","s":["H0410"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; Give ear, O "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[5]},{"t":", to the "},{"t":"voice","s":["H6963"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of my "},{"t":"supplications","s":["H8469"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"O Jehovah Lord, strength of my salvation, You have covered my head in the day of battle.","tok":[{"t":"O Jehovah "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[1]},{"t":", "},{"t":"strength","s":["H5797"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of my "},{"t":"salvation","s":["H3444"],"a":[3]},{"t":", You have "},{"t":"covered","s":["H5526"],"a":[4]},{"t":" my "},{"t":"head","s":["H7218"],"a":[5]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"battle","s":["H5402"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"O Jehovah, do not grant the desires of the wicked man; Do not let his evil scheme advance, Lest he be exalted. Selah","tok":[{"t":"O","s":["H5414"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":", do not "},{"t":"grant","s":["H5414"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"desires","s":["H3970"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[4]},{"t":" man; Do not let his evil scheme advance, Lest he be "},{"t":"exalted","s":["H7311"],"a":[8]},{"t":". "},{"t":"Selah","s":["H5542"],"a":[9]}]},{"n":9,"text":"As for the head of those who surround me, May the mischief of their own lips cover them.","tok":[{"t":"As for the "},{"t":"head","s":["H7218"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of those who surround me, May the "},{"t":"mischief","s":["H5999"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of their own "},{"t":"lips","s":["H8193"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"cover","s":["H3680"],"a":[4]},{"t":" them."}]},{"n":10,"text":"May burning coals drop down upon them; May they be thrown down into the fire, Into deep pits, never to rise again.","tok":[{"t":"May burning "},{"t":"coals","s":["H1513"],"a":[2]},{"t":" drop down upon them; May they be thrown down into the "},{"t":"fire","s":["H0784"],"a":[3]},{"t":", Into deep "},{"t":"pits","s":["H4113"],"a":[5]},{"t":", never to rise "},{"t":"again","s":["H6965"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"Let no slanderer be established in the land; Let evil hunt down the violent man speedily.","tok":[{"t":"Let no slanderer be "},{"t":"established","s":["H3559"],"a":[3]},{"t":" in the land; Let "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"hunt","s":["H6679"],"a":[8]},{"t":" down the "},{"t":"violent","s":["H2555"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"speedily","s":["H4073"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":12,"text":"I know that Jehovah will maintain the cause of the afflicted And justice for the needy.","tok":[{"t":"I "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[0]},{"t":" that "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"maintain","s":["H6213"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"cause","s":["H1779"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"afflicted","s":["H6041"],"a":[5]},{"t":" And justice for the needy."}]},{"n":13,"text":"Surely the righteous will give thanks to Your name; The upright will dwell in Your presence.","tok":[{"t":"Surely the "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[1]},{"t":" will give "},{"t":"thanks","s":["H3034"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to Your "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; The "},{"t":"upright","s":["H3477"],"a":[5]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"dwell","s":["H3427"],"a":[4]},{"t":" in Your "},{"t":"presence","s":["H6440"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]}]}
